### OnlineChat secrets — NEVER commit these ###
# TLS private material (cert + private key) loaded from the run/working directory.
/ssl/
# Web accounts, bindings and the auto-generated HMAC token secret.
/onlinechat/
# ...but never ignore anything that legitimately lives under src/.
!**/src/**/ssl/
!**/src/**/onlinechat/
